#sortorder:1
#showas:Zenith 猛攻
This is a Zenith-centric scenario featuring all-new Zenith factions as well as those in the base game. Experiences will greatly vary in consequence.

It is recommended to first play "A Dark Alliance" (for Dark Zenith exposure) or "The Zenith Arena" (for Zenith Architrave exposure) to get familiar with the new Zenith races.

In this scenario, you will face the Reservist AI (difficulty 7), which responds to deepstriking behavior one planet sooner than other AIs, and stronger Cross Planet Attacks (CPA's). 

This galaxy also features nomad planets, one of which mobilizing the Dyson Sphere.

The Dark Zenith won't invade the galaxy until roughly 90 minutes into the game.